---
source: src/setup/mod.rs
expression: "plan(Profile::Server)"
---
hpds setup --profile server runs these 15 steps:
  1. system libraries (apt)
       sudo apt-get update
       sudo apt-get install -y build-essential ca-certificates curl gnupg gdebi-core libcurl4-openssl-dev libfontconfig1-dev libfreetype6-dev libfribidi-dev libgit2-dev libharfbuzz-dev libjpeg-dev libpng-dev libssl-dev libtiff5-dev libxml2-dev unixodbc-dev zlib1g-dev
  2. Docker Engine
       install Docker Engine from download.docker.com/linux/ubuntu (docker-ce docker-ce-cli containerd.io docker-buildx-plugin docker-compose-plugin) and add <user> to the docker group
  3. stable Rust
       install or update stable Rust with verified rustup
  4. R + CRAN/PPM repositories
       hpds install r
       ensure the Posit Package Manager CRAN repository line is present once
  5. Python + PPM pip configuration
       sudo apt-get install -y python3 python3-pip python3-venv
       sudo sh -c printf '[global]\nindex-url = https://packagemanager.posit.co/pypi/latest/simple\n' > /etc/pip.conf
  6. quarto
       hpds install quarto (latest stable)
  7. tinytex
       hpds install tinytex
  8. RStudio Server
       hpds install rstudio-server (latest stable)
  9. RStudio preferences
       merge RStudio preferences: insert_native_pipe_operator=true save_workspace=never load_workspace=never rainbow_parentheses=true rainbow_fenced_divs=true
 10. code-server + extensions
       download the code-server installer to a secure temporary file and run it
       code-server --install-extension ms-python.python
       set quarto.path to <home>/.local/bin/quarto and systemctl enable --now code-server@<user>
       code-server --install-extension ms-toolsai.jupyter
       code-server --install-extension quarto.quarto
       code-server --install-extension charliermarsh.ruff
 11. gh
       hpds install gh (latest stable)
 12. duckdb
       hpds install duckdb (latest stable)
 13. uv + ruff + sqlfluff
       hpds install uv (latest stable)
       uv tool install --upgrade ruff
       uv tool install --upgrade sqlfluff
       uv tool update-shell
 14. rig
       hpds install rig
 15. git defaults
       hpds git setup
